prompt:
An automation response contains this valid JSON. The order of entries shown is the array order.

```json
{
  "interfaces": [
    {"name": "GigabitEthernet0/1", "addresses": ["10.2.1.1"]},
    {"name": "GigabitEthernet0/2", "addresses": ["10.2.2.1", "10.2.3.1"]}
  ]
}
```

Which address is the **second value in the addresses array for GigabitEthernet0/2**? Select one.
